                      icon: Icons.description_outlined,
                      onPressed: _continue,
                    ),
                  ],
                ),
              ),
            ],
          ),
        ),
      ),
    );
  }
}

int contractYearsForTier(int tier) {
  return switch (tier) {
    1 => 3,
    2 => 3,
    3 => 4,
    4 => 4,
    _ => 5,
  };
}

int contractExtensionYearsForScore(int score) {
  if (score >= 82) return 3;
  if (score >= 65) return 2;
  if (score >= 48) return 1;
  return 0;
}

// The contract's years-remaining figure after an offseason's contract
// decision: a new job resets to a fresh contract for the new program's
// tier; staying at the same job ticks the old figure down by the season
// just played, then adds whatever extension was earned. Never returns 0 —
// there's no "fired" consequence modeled, so a dead countdown would just
// read as broken.
int contractYearsAfterOffseason({
  required bool tookNewJob,
  required int previousYearsRemaining,
  required int newJobPrestige,
  required int extensionYears,
}) {
  if (tookNewJob) {
    return contractYearsForTier(prestigeTier(newJobPrestige));
  }
  final afterThisSeason = max(1, previousYearsRemaining - 1);
  return afterThisSeason + extensionYears;
}

